<body>
    <h1>17. User Review Disputes</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <ul local-id=3D"597475ec020f">
<li local-id=3D"c2bdcc8d1836">
<p local-id=3D"059a52937227"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090364/17.+User+Review+Disputes#User-Reports-%26-Ge=
neral-Allegations" rel=3D"nofollow">User Reports &amp; General Allegations<=
/a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f9300649e551">
<p local-id=3D"99a20d2c38dd"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090364/17.+User+Review+Disputes#Standard-Handling-P=
rocess" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Standard Handling Process</u></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9615f86f0abe">
<p local-id=3D"e2638fb32d5e"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090364/17.+User+Review+Disputes#Action-Table%3A-Spe=
cific-Content-Types" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>Action Table: Specific Content Typ=
es</u></a></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"18b3eb27bc2b">
<p local-id=3D"453129ca841e"><a href=3D"https://tripadvisor.atlassian.net/w=
iki/spaces/ASK/pages/300090364/17.+User+Review+Disputes#Viator-Reviews" rel=
=3D"nofollow"><u>Viator Reviews</u></a></p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"f40d22676e97" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-UserReports&am=
p;GeneralAllegations"><strong>User Reports &amp; General Allegations</stron=
g></h1>
<p local-id=3D"8f685c9738be">Users can report inappropriate content or pote=
ntial guideline violations via on-site voting or by emailing <code>contenti=
ntegrity@tripadvisor.com</code>.</p>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #FFBDAD;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #FFBDAD;">
<p local-id=3D"4f5af3d80644"><strong>Non-Affiliated Reports:</strong> Treat=
 all reports from non-affiliated individuals as <strong>standard user repor=
ts</strong>, regardless of any claims of affiliation they might make.</p>
</div>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"e34532b2-47b0-4b77-98a4-a83392978565">
<h1 local-id=3D"dd580228764a" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-StandardHandli=
ngProcess"><strong>Standard Handling Process</strong></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"ed0efcaef98b" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-1.Preparation"=
><strong>1. Preparation</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"1bff25ee-0990-43f4-ba74-ea8f7fc55941">
<li local-id=3D"1d397aa8-5186-4f64-9015-88b342a9d111">
<p local-id=3D"801dcdd62dcc"><strong>Manage Duplicates:</strong> Merge mult=
iple tickets from the same user regarding the same issue into one active ti=
cket before responding.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"af8a0031bea1" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-2.LocatetheDis=
putedReview"><strong>2. Locate the Disputed Review</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"62fc1cb9fe94">If the review isn't linked, use these methods =
to identify it:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"49c36438-7803-45a5-88a1-121792dd1346">
<li local-id=3D"c164bf3b-1760-488e-8544-c277eb047803">
<p local-id=3D"903de22ab347"><strong>URD Search:</strong> Search the user's=
 email as the <strong>"Voter Email."</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"45b8d89a-c939-43b1-9c7e-461b651919a1">
<p local-id=3D"af1a9ddc626a"><strong>Subject Line Check:</strong> Look for =
Review IDs or Titles in the ticket subject.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4a1719c1-9bbc-4dda-be9d-f4826c3f0b01">
<p local-id=3D"dcc04b201146"><strong>Property Search:</strong> Cross-refere=
nce provided titles with the property=E2=80=99s review list or via a Google=
 search.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0eff4849-90e6-42df-8cc2-e4b4b57a5eb4">
<p local-id=3D"39b933a8d47a"><strong>Clarification:</strong> If still uncer=
tain, ask the user to confirm the link/title. If they cannot, use the <stro=
ng>Dispute =E2=80=93 Not Specific Enough</strong> macro (edited for users).=
</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"e847091deee9" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-3.Review&amp;D=
ocumentation"><strong>3. Review &amp; Documentation</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"1702c9f5-945c-451e-8241-d665932da6bb">
<li local-id=3D"70c4e560-4db4-417f-bfb3-51ff1b2b08d3">
<p local-id=3D"591e16ec5b0b"><strong>Evidence:</strong> Request specific ev=
idence if not provided or if clarity is needed for the investigation.</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"28cf2998-67d0-4366-9ea9-f9e4548887d8">
<p local-id=3D"58e00a19de1e"><strong>Apply Guidelines:</strong> Evaluate th=
e review against <strong>CI/CM guidelines</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cc1d9769-fbdb-47c3-afb8-8619e63ce84b">
<p local-id=3D"e3537b4e9a4a"><strong>Documentation:</strong> * Add URD comm=
ents explaining your decision.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6ee5f08c-927b-4319-9ce0-b044548a72df">
<li local-id=3D"68a230c5-82de-4b55-aff7-fb4cca800c38">
<p local-id=3D"8f5670d8ee81">Enter Review/Location IDs in the ZD ticket fie=
lds.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"47d841a6-4d94-4613-9d36-6f2bfec74905">
<p local-id=3D"ed98a2556cd8">Perform a property sweep if a pattern is detec=
ted.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p local-id=3D"a8e6f3bce516"><strong>No Vote Rule:</strong> If the user has=
 not cast a vote on-site and no removal is planned, instruct them to use th=
e <strong>on-site dispute tool</strong> before emailing us.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"24d9ca218fc2" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-4.FinalRespons=
e"><strong>4. Final Response</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"e5a436af9a0b">Use the <strong>Allegation of Fraud</strong> m=
acro. <strong>Do not</strong> disclose internal investigation methods. You =
may also use the following standardized text:</p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"481b1b8b-84d3-43a1-bbdc-d64817e14aad">
<p local-id=3D"72ca91005a00"><em>"Thank you for your report. We will review=
 the content in question and make any appropriate changes. Due to our priva=
cy policy, I am unable to follow up with details regarding the investigatio=
n. Thank you for your participation and understanding."</em></p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"6b8a0427-4186-4377-b99e-a9aa5c4c0ad0">
<h1 local-id=3D"a6550d3800a5" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-ActionTable:Sp=
ecificContentTypes"><strong>Action Table: Specific Content Types</strong></=
h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6=
e092015-c4cb-4a11-b346-5b0d07a78575" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"863cf341-7b3b-41ba-a90c-9d93e596a87c">
<th data-local-id=3D"5c33597d-e887-447a-8d5f-c599b686b539" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"aaff4d867e5a">Content Type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e76cd3c9-a0fb-4649-aa50-389bc2d39d9b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"afb65b0bfaa7">Action to Take</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c046576e-7404-4f0e-a366-6f180fb7e3ab">
<td data-local-id=3D"a7dad97e-3a93-416f-93ba-ea9e498d5be2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"237846a0acac"><strong>Owner Response (Privacy)</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3a05965d-a4b6-43b7-b834-e3cb6bfee9b4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cfe884f544ce">If an OR reveals user info (real name, phone, =
email, employer) not in their profile, <strong>remove the OR</strong>.</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1ed41e53-1770-4d4e-9bf8-e907286b5dac">
<td data-local-id=3D"bf1b1b24-32e3-44c5-b5d0-b1d22b63a660" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aae201ff93ee"><strong>Standard Photo Violation</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"390a3c5d-67c6-45f6-af55-2a61af5fdbc6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3a3cfd99eada">If the photo shows selfies, logos, or spam, <s=
trong>remove the photo</strong>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b0681e2c-a796-4f7f-992a-235f12059bcd">
<td data-local-id=3D"ff5d9712-2c61-46bf-b1ed-79b657ede908" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5fc91cb736c8"><strong>Illegal Photo Content</strong></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"94044aa0-2848-405e-8dd9-e790a4f33e9a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f248d26c3e12">If the photo shows illegal activity, drugs, or=
 escort services, <strong>escalate to Tier 2</strong> for a member ban.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8bb716c9-26bf-43d6-a076-a6b7cfe5094c">
<td data-local-id=3D"fd8fea33-1994-480f-80b2-43e660352f6c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"84151ca8517c"><strong>User Privacy (Photo)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d2119bce-0893-4a04-8acd-5220be8b0763" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10149683ff4f">If a user reports a photo of themselves posted=
 by someone else, <strong>remove the photo</strong>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f5e97a65-9b6d-424b-808c-f7cb377d294a">
<td data-local-id=3D"2a5f5359-d230-43a8-8b44-d375dd5359bc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f7accb9c7a49"><strong>Voter Templates</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c95a2cc4-464e-4652-a447-69b5f7913822" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8e4b626cf343">If a user claims to have not received a templa=
te sent in the last 3 months, <strong>resend it</strong>.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"bc1a962c-ac0a-497c-ad86-69a95d335bb6">
<h1 local-id=3D"bb68c0d3e73b" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-ViatorReviews"=
><strong>Viator Reviews</strong></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"05dc714c9649" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-Moderation"><s=
trong>Moderation</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"36f7e018165f">Fraud Support can moderate Viator reviews in r=
esponse to user inquiries.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5e312707-ab1a-4521-9b84-417e504c2a33">
<li local-id=3D"f1d25de4-3cf2-4506-ac90-267155d47341">
<p local-id=3D"451ddcdf2fcc"><strong>Action:</strong> Take appropriate CI/C=
M actions directly on the Viator review.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"62ba4ad7-b5ec-4817-aebd-8db4959eaab7">
<p local-id=3D"a54eed82055d"><strong>Review Edits:</strong> If a user wants=
 to <em>change</em> their Viator review, direct them to contact <a class=3D=
"external-link" href=3D"mailto:customer.care@viator.com" rel=3D"nofollow"><=
strong>customer.care@viator.com</strong></a>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"91a25892de7b" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-DuplicateConte=
ntonViatorReviews"><strong>Duplicate Content on Viator Reviews</strong></h2=
>
<p local-id=3D"c3baa969e9a6">It is common for members to submit the same re=
view text via their personal Tripadvisor account and their temporary Viator=
 booking email (<code>vi_123456789@tripadvisor.com</code>).</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<ul local-id=3D"49d7b3e3-3bf3-41e3-8846-725da20f6df4">
<li local-id=3D"5e61b9b3-5d59-4694-856f-a8a93737893e">
<p local-id=3D"94ff4103db10"><strong>Policy:</strong> It is <strong>accepta=
ble</strong> to leave both reviews published; do not remove them as duplica=
tes.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"1046fecc-4e7f-426b-8daf-667d125764af">
<h1 local-id=3D"0d364885b8e5" id=3D"id-17.UserReviewDisputes-AgentQuickTips=
"><strong>Agent Quick Tips</strong></h1>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<ul local-id=3D"4b01968f-84e5-4018-9a84-f0cdb0395ffe">
<li local-id=3D"fc48966e-3237-4352-8f8b-28f603723d79">
<p local-id=3D"ec63225d760f"><strong>Privacy First:</strong> Never confirm =
to a user whether their report resulted in another user being penalized.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"98cb43ca-96a1-4fe2-b2d4-b57e3310dddf">
<p local-id=3D"7d6c54aac70b"><strong>Macro Editing:</strong> Always ensure =
the "Dispute Not Specific" macro is edited to address a <em>user</em> rathe=
r than an <em>owner</em>.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
